# dh-cargo path — pulls every Rust dep from `librust-*-dev` packages in
# the Debian / Ubuntu archive.  See README in this directory for the
# current version-mismatch blockers (gtk4, libadwaita, glib, if-addrs).
#
# Direct Build-Deps mirror the workspace `Cargo.toml` `[dependencies]`
# block.  Transitive deps come along via the apt dependency solver from
# the librust-*-dev metapackages; we only list crates we name directly.
